File vi du: bundle khoa cong khai noi bo (Secure Mail)
==============================================================

- Day la KHOA VI DU do admin tao de minh hoa dinh dang file .asc.
- KHONG dung khoa nay cho lien lac that. Thay bang khoa cong khai that cua nhan vien.
- Mot file bundle co the chua NHIEU khoi "PUBLIC KEY BLOCK" noi tiep nhau;
  extension se import tat ca cac khoa trong file.
- Chi duoc phep dua KHOA CONG KHAI vao file nay. TUYET DOI KHONG dua PRIVATE KEY.

